  "title": "Amazing and Easy Chicken Wings",
  "description": "This easy chicken wings recipe includes a delicious marinade and basting sauce made with brown sugar, soy, and mustard sauce for the best baked wings!",
  "authors": [
    "Rebecca O- hingham, MA"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:10:08-05:00",
